                                                    <fixVersion>2.8</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>1</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16754767" author="sboikov" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 09:09:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I believe method IgniteSpiContext.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;validateNode(ClusterNode node, DiscoveryDataBag discoData) was added after ZK discovery was implemented.&#160;Changed&#160;ZookeeperDiscoveryImpl to use it instead&#160; IgniteSpiContext.validateNode(ClusterNode node).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fixed&#160;in master (13b81f01aa37b1b32ac776f1819e20a8d1c1015f).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755000" author="ibessonov" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 13:08:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I believe that old &quot;validateNode&quot; method (with one parameter) should be invoked as well, just like it is done in &quot;ServerImpl&quot; class, otherwise we will break many other services.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755810" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 30 Jan 2019 07:56:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ibessonov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ibessonov&quot;&gt;ibessonov&lt;/a&gt;, thanks for your comment, I fixed this add added sanity test in ZK discovery suite (bcf8118574c9e9d86ad585c4785ad7a3726ee07a).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755914" author="ibessonov" created="Wed, 30 Jan 2019 09:35:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt; thank you, it&apos;s much better now!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
